                <num>1</num>
                <content>
                  <p>(1)	The amendments made by items 7 to 9 and 11 to 23<i> </i>apply in relation to the PHA year in which this item commences and each later PHA year.</p>
                </content>
              </subsection>
              <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-3__item-23__subsec-2">
                <num>2</num>
                <content>
                  <p>(2)	The amendments of <ref href="#sec-10C">section 10C</ref> of the <i>Plant Health Australia (Plant Industries) Funding Act 2002 </i>made by this Schedule apply in relation to payments made by PHA on or after the commencement of this item.</p>
                </content>
              </subsection>
